0.1.1

  *  The carry into cs_hi is now suppressed on the final loop iteration using
     the multiplier (1 - % / %%), exploiting fasmg integer division to produce
     0 on the last step and 1 on all others. Matches the fix applied in the
     apogee (0.2.3).

